    "headline": "All-India housing prices rises 6% YoY in 1QFY27 led by key markets: Kotak",
    "body": "In the first quarter of fiscal year twenty twenty-seven, real estate prices experienced a significant six percent year-over-year rise. Major cities such as New Delhi, Noida, Chennai, Greater Noida, and Bengaluru spearheaded this trend. While residential sales saw a moderate three percent uptick, the launch of new projects declined alongside an increase in unsold inventories in areas like Bengaluru, Hyderabad, and NCR, illustrating a complex market dynamic.",
