    "headline": "Delhi’s 1,459 heritage assets face ‘severe threat’, master plan calls for stronger conservation",
    "body": "Delhi's Master Plan 2047 identifies 1,459 heritage assets facing significant threats. The plan emphasizes enhanced conservation and regular monitoring of these historical sites. Local bodies will establish heritage cells for management and promotion of cultural activities. Adaptive reuse of historic structures is encouraged to prevent degradation and loss. The plan aims to preserve Delhi's rich cultural and historical character for future generations.",
