    "headline": "Retail inflation may cross 6 per cent in Oct-Nov before easing in Q4 FY27: Report",
    "body": "Retail inflation in India may briefly surpass 6 percent in late 2024. This rise is expected before easing to approximately 5 percent by early 2026. Improving food supply conditions and monsoon recovery will help contain inflation. The Reserve Bank of India awaits more inflation data before adjusting policy rates. Global market implications arise from US Federal Reserve actions on treasury yields.",
