    "body": "The government is in the final stages of choosing alternative investment firms for the research fund, with the decision expected to wrap up in the coming fortnight. Meanwhile, funds are actively being allocated to other selected firms for investment purposes. Robust safeguards are implemented to ensure protection for both public and private capital, reinforcing transparency and accountability in the fund's management.",
